  "noticeTitle": "Road Bash™ 2026",
  "@noticeTitle": {
    "description": "Heading of the ride-safe notice"
  },
  "noticeFun": "I developed this game to recreate the childhood memories of the classic Road Rash Game by EA Sports specifically the 1991 version. Games like this are a great way to enjoy virtual realities without the risks of getting hurt.\n\nI hope you enjoy playing this game as I do both developing and playing it. Please share it with your family and friends so that you may not enjoy alone not unless you are greedy.",
  "@noticeFun": {
    "description": "First notice paragraph"
  },
  "noticeWarning": "This game is work in progress and because of that it may be having a shitty UI and controls. If you have suggestions or complaints feel free to text me on X or email me on sirodevske@gmail.com.\n\nIf you are a developer head over to my Github @SiroDevs and start contributing. Use your head!",
  "@noticeWarning": {
    "description": "Safety warning paragraph"
  },
