  "blurbThikaRoad": "Blue Post to Museum Hill, the whole Thika Rd run through Juja, Kimbo, Ruiru, Kahawa, Githurai and Roysambu, then down the Pangani underpass. Flyovers, footbridges and slip roads. Keep it clean to the finish.",
  "@blurbThikaRoad": {
    "description": "Thika Rd description"
  },
  "blurbJungle": "Thick rainforest on a narrow, twisting blacktop. Steep climbs, tight bends and trees right at the edge. Brake early, stay on the tarmac.",
  "@blurbJungle": {
    "description": "Jungle description"
  },
  "blurbDirtRoad": "Red murram through open dry country. Long straights, rolling crests and wide, dusty bends. No lines to follow, so pick your rut.",
